{"seq":3,"slug":"signing-and-security","title":"签名与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/signing-and-security","wordCount":837,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"签名与安全\">签名与安全</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要签名\">为什么需要签名</h2><p>Git 默认的 <code>user.name</code> 和 <code>user.email</code> 配置可以被任意设置——任何人都可以冒充他人提交代码。<strong>提交签名（Commit Signing）</strong> 使用密码学手段验证提交确实由声称的作者创建，在安全敏感场景下至关重要。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>身份冒充</td>\n<td>伪造 author 信息提交恶意代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链攻击</td>\n<td>通过伪造提交注入后门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计不可靠</td>\n<td>无法确认变更的真实来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规要求</td>\n<td>某些行业标准要求签名提交</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>提交安全建立在&quot;证明身份&quot;和&quot;管理凭证&quot;两条主线上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提交签名</td>\n<td>用密钥对提交对象签名，证明作者身份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名验证</td>\n<td>用公钥校验签名，平台显示 Verified 标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPG</td>\n<td>传统签名方案，兼容性最广</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSH 签名</td>\n<td>Git 2.34+ 复用 SSH 密钥的简化方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凭证管理</td>\n<td>安全存放 Git 认证信息（Keychain/PAT 等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密钥扫描</td>\n<td>用 gitleaks 等工具在提交前发现泄露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fsckObjects</td>\n<td>传输/接收时校验对象完整性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gpg-签名\">GPG 签名</h2><p><strong>GPG（GNU Privacy Guard）</strong> 是最传统也最广泛支持的签名方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gpg --full-generate-key&#10;&#10;gpg --list-secret-keys --keyid-format=long&#10;# sec   ed25519/ABCDEF1234567890 2025-01-01&#10;&#10;git config --global user.signingkey ABCDEF1234567890&#10;git config --global commit.gpgsign true&#10;git config --global tag.gpgSign true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gpg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --full-generate-key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gpg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --list-secret-keys</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --keyid-format=long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># sec   ed25519/ABCDEF1234567890 2025-01-01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user.signingkey</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ABCDEF1234567890</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit.gpgsign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag.gpgSign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git commit -S -m &quot;feat: signed commit&quot;&#10;&#10;git log --show-signature -1&#10;&#10;git tag -s v1.0.0 -m &quot;Release v1.0.0&quot;&#10;git tag -v v1.0.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: signed commit\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --show-signature</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.0.0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Release v1.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.0.0</span></span></code></pre></div><p>导出公钥并添加到 GitHub：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gpg --armor --export ABCDEF1234567890&#10;&#10;# 复制输出，粘贴到 GitHub → Settings → SSH and GPG keys → New GPG key\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gpg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --armor</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --export</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ABCDEF1234567890</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 复制输出，粘贴到 GitHub → Settings → SSH and GPG keys → New GPG key</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[开发者私钥] --&gt;|签名| B[Commit]&#10;    B --&gt;|push| C[GitHub]&#10;    C --&gt;|公钥验证| D[&quot;Verified ✅&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[开发者私钥] --&gt;|签名| B[Commit]\n    B --&gt;|push| C[GitHub]\n    C --&gt;|公钥验证| D[\"Verified ✅\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 macOS 上建议使用 <code>gpg-agent</code> 缓存密码短语，避免每次提交都输入密码。配置 <code>GPG_TTY=$(tty)</code> 解决终端问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ssh-签名\">SSH 签名</h2><p>Git 2.34+ 支持使用 <strong>SSH 密钥</strong>进行签名，复用已有的 SSH 密钥，无需额外管理 GPG：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global gpg.format ssh&#10;git config --global user.signingkey ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub&#10;git config --global commit.gpgsign true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gpg.format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ssh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user.signingkey</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit.gpgsign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置允许的签名者列表（本地验证）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile ~/.ssh/allowed_signers&#10;&#10;echo &quot;user@example.com ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3Nz...&quot; &gt;&gt; ~/.ssh/allowed_signers&#10;&#10;git log --show-signature -1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.ssh/allowed_signers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"user@example.com ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3Nz...\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.ssh/allowed_signers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --show-signature</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -1</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>GPG</th>\n<th>SSH</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>密钥管理</td>\n<td>复杂（需 GPG 套件）</td>\n<td>简单（复用 SSH）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git 版本要求</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>2.34+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台支持</td>\n<td>GitHub/GitLab/全部</td>\n<td>GitHub/GitLab</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信任模型</td>\n<td>Web of Trust</td>\n<td>允许列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐场景</td>\n<td>企业/高安全要求</td>\n<td>个人/团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"verified-commits\">Verified Commits</h2><p>GitHub 和 GitLab 会在签名验证通过的 commit 旁显示 <strong>&quot;Verified&quot;</strong> 标记：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Verified ✅</td>\n<td>签名有效，密钥已关联到账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Partially ⚠️</td>\n<td>签名有效，但密钥未关联账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unverified ❌</td>\n<td>签名无效或无签名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>强制要求签名提交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# GitHub 仓库设置&#10;# Settings → Branches → Branch protection rules&#10;# ✅ Require signed commits\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub 仓库设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Settings → Branches → Branch protection rules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ✅ Require signed commits</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"credential-安全管理\">Credential 安全管理</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>安全级别</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SSH Key</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>推荐方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>macOS Keychain</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>macOS</td>\n<td>系统级安全存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows Credential</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>系统凭据管理器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PAT（Token）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>替代密码认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gh CLI</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>GitHub 官方 CLI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global credential.helper osxkeychain&#10;&#10;ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C &quot;user@example.com&quot;&#10;eval &quot;$(ssh-agent -s)&quot;&#10;ssh-add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519&#10;&#10;ssh -T git@github.com\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> credential.helper</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> osxkeychain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ssh-keygen</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ed25519</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -C</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"user@example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ssh-agent</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ssh-add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.ssh/id_ed25519</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ssh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -T</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git@github.com</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> GitHub 已于 2021 年停止支持密码认证。使用 SSH Key 或 PAT（Personal Access Token）是当前的标准方案。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"安全审计\">安全审计</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gitleaks detect --source . --verbose&#10;gitleaks protect --staged&#10;&#10;git log --format=&#39;%H %an &lt;%ae&gt;&#39; --no-walk --stdin &lt; &lt;(git rev-list --all) | sort -k2 | uniq -f1&#10;&#10;git shortlog -sne\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gitleaks</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> detect</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verbose</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gitleaks</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> protect</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --staged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%H %an &#x3C;%ae>'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-walk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stdin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rev-list </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">--all</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -k2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shortlog</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sne</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>审计工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>gitleaks</td>\n<td>扫描敏感信息泄露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trufflehog</td>\n<td>深度扫描密钥和凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git-secrets</td>\n<td>AWS 密钥扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub Secret Scanning</td>\n<td>平台级自动扫描</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[pre-commit: gitleaks]&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| C[push]&#10;    C --&gt; D[GitHub Secret Scanning]&#10;    D --&gt;|发现泄露| E[通知 + 轮换密钥]&#10;    D --&gt;|安全| F[合并]\">graph TD\n    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[pre-commit: gitleaks]\n    B --&gt;|通过| C[push]\n    C --&gt; D[GitHub Secret Scanning]\n    D --&gt;|发现泄露| E[通知 + 轮换密钥]\n    D --&gt;|安全| F[合并]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"安全配置清单\">安全配置清单</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global commit.gpgsign true&#10;git config --global tag.gpgSign true&#10;git config --global credential.helper osxkeychain&#10;git config --global init.defaultBranch main&#10;git config --global transfer.fsckObjects true&#10;git config --global fetch.fsckObjects true&#10;git config --global receive.fsckObjects true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit.gpgsign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag.gpgSign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> credential.helper</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> osxkeychain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init.defaultBranch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> transfer.fsckObjects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch.fsckObjects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> receive.fsckObjects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>commit.gpgsign</code></td>\n<td>默认签名所有提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transfer.fsckObjects</code></td>\n<td>传输时验证对象完整性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>receive.fsckObjects</code></td>\n<td>接收时验证对象完整性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>init.defaultBranch</code></td>\n<td>设置默认分支名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((签名与安全))&#10;    签名方式&#10;      GPG 传统方案&#10;      SSH 简单方案&#10;      Verified 标记&#10;    凭证管理&#10;      SSH Key&#10;      Keychain&#10;      gh CLI&#10;    安全审计&#10;      gitleaks&#10;      trufflehog&#10;      Secret Scanning&#10;    配置&#10;      gpgsign&#10;      fsckObjects&#10;      credential.helper\">mindmap\n  root((签名与安全))\n    签名方式\n      GPG 传统方案\n      SSH 简单方案\n      Verified 标记\n    凭证管理\n      SSH Key\n      Keychain\n      gh CLI\n    安全审计\n      gitleaks\n      trufflehog\n      Secret Scanning\n    配置\n      gpgsign\n      fsckObjects\n      credential.helper</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>GPG 签名</strong>是最广泛支持的方案，<strong>SSH 签名</strong>更简单（Git 2.34+），根据安全需求选择</li>\n<li>开启 <code>commit.gpgsign=true</code> 默认签名所有提交，并在仓库中要求 <strong>Verified</strong> 标记</li>\n<li>使用 <strong>SSH Key</strong> 或 <strong>系统凭证管理器</strong>安全存储认证信息，避免明文存储</li>\n<li><strong>gitleaks</strong> 和 <strong>GitHub Secret Scanning</strong> 是检测敏感信息泄露的两道防线</li>\n<li>开启 <code>fsckObjects</code> 确保 Git 对象在传输过程中的<strong>完整性验证</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"签名与安全","id":"签名与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要签名","id":"为什么需要签名"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GPG 签名","id":"gpg-签名"},{"level":2,"text":"SSH 签名","id":"ssh-签名"},{"level":2,"text":"Verified Commits","id":"verified-commits"},{"level":2,"text":"Credential 安全管理","id":"credential-安全管理"},{"level":2,"text":"安全审计","id":"安全审计"},{"level":2,"text":"安全配置清单","id":"安全配置清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Git LFS 大文件存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/git-lfs"},"next":{"title":"GUI 与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/gui-and-tools"}}